{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262ZOpbdiiAO1793009214.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>藥明康德首三季多賺六成二。</p><p></p><p>純利191.6億元人民幣。期內收入455.3億元人民幣，按年增長近三成九。持續經營收入升幅四成六。</p><p></p><p>另外，集團上調全年業績指引。預計收入介乎610億至619億元人民幣，持續經營業務收入，按年增長四成至四成二。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:53.585254+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T17:38:18.511104+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:10.928111+00:00","content_hash":"318d4b19ffccd5df0a50a135e716d2a2f24327bbac3ac8fe578cb4f2ffd14ad7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}